 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Every December, Nora bought her brother hiking gear.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.157
  },
  {
   "text": "Every year, it was the wrong size, or something he already owned.",
   "start": 3.657,
   "end": 7.21
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. Give him a way to plan and remember his hikes.",
   "start": 7.81,
   "end": 11.374
  },
  {
   "text": "A trail journal for every hike,",
   "start": 11.824,
   "end": 13.408
  },
  {
   "text": "a tracker for the national parks,",
   "start": 13.658,
   "end": 15.377
  },
  {
   "text": "and a planner for the next trip.",
   "start": 15.627,
   "end": 17.05
  },
  {
   "text": "Print it, wrap it, done.",
   "start": 17.55,
   "end": 18.765
  },
  {
   "text": "By February, his journal had six hikes in it.",
   "start": 19.465,
   "end": 21.996
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for your gift list.",
   "start": 22.596,
   "end": 24.022
  }
 ],
